{
  "prompt": "For each server in serverTable, ping it and email admin if down",
  "telemetry_session_id": "sess_33dd830ca5be",
  "decomposition": "```json\n{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s1\",\n      \"description\": \"Initialize a counter variable for iterating through the server table.\",\n      \"intent\": \"initialize_variable\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"pre_container\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s2\",\n      \"description\": \"Get the total number of rows in the serverTable to control the loop.\",\n      \"intent\": \"count_rows\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"linear\",\n      \"zone\": \"pre_container\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s3\",\n      \"description\": \"Begin a While loop to process each server in the table.\",\n      \"intent\": \"loop\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"while\",\n      \"zone\": \"container\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s4\",\n      \"description\": \"Exit the loop if the counter exceeds the total number of rows.\",\n      \"intent\": \"exit_loop\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"while\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s5\",\n      \"description\": \"Get the server name from the current row of the serverTable.\",\n      \"intent\": \"get_cell\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"while\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s6\",\n      \"description\": \"Ping the retrieved server to check its status.\",\n      \"intent\": \"other\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"while\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s7\",\n      \"description\": \"Check the result of the ping to determine if the server is down.\",\n      \"intent\": \"branch\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"ifelse\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s8\",\n      \"description\": \"If the server is down, send an email notification to the administrator.\",\n      \"intent\": \"send_email\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"ifelse\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"step_id\": \"s9\",\n      \"description\": \"Increment the loop counter to move to the next server.\",\n      \"intent\": \"set_variable\",\n      \"control_flow\": \"while\",\n      \"zone\": \"container_body\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"variable_contract\": {\n    \"variables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"serverTable\",\n        \"type\": \"table\",\n        \"source\": \"external — must exist before workflow runs\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"memorySet1\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"initialized to 0 for loop counter\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"getRowsCount1\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"result of GetRowsCount activity\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"getCellValue1\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"result of GetCellValue activity for server name\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"ping1\",\n        \"type\": \"string\",\n        \"source\": \"result of Ping activity\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"loop_type\": \"While\",\n    \"loop_source\": \"serverTable\"\n  },\n  \"complexity\": \"moderate\",\n  \"estimated_activity_count\": 9\n}\n```",
